      "entries": [
        "When the wight damages a living creature with its claw or ranseur Strike, the wight gains 12 temporary Hit Points and the creature must succeed at a DC 29 Fortitude save or become drained|CRB|drained 1. Further damage dealt by the wight increases the amount of drain by 1 on a failed save, to a maximum of drained|CRB|drained 4."
